      "main_attrib_1": "DEX",
      "main_attrib_2": "INS",
      "main_details": "<p>You may perform the Inventory action and spend 3 Inventory Points to create a firearm weapon known as a magicannon (see below). The magicannon will crumble to pieces as soon as you use create a new magicannon. When you create a magicannon, choose the type of damage it deals (air, bolt, earth, fire, ice, or physical)</p>",
