      "name": "Rilmelia",
      "notes_text": "<p>Quirk</p>\n<p>Survivor - Permanently increase your maximum Hit Points and maximum Mind Points by 5.<br>Choose one option: gain the ability to equip martial melee and ranged weapons, martial armor, and martial shields; or learn any one spell from the Elementalist or Spiritist lists; or permanently increase your maximum Inventory Points by 2</p>\n<p>(* choose - IP+2)</p>",
